{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/0188464f6604bb7859ea87fcbef3c2a4.avif?t=1762420869\" width=754 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a farm manager and take on the KPI challenges set by TimeTech Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards in thrilling, fast-paced moments,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dodge or harness Time Explosions \ud83d\udca5,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unlock card packs and treasure chests to expand your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your cards to earn gold,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and chart your own path with strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll face branching events, harsh years, and even massive world-shaking cataclysms. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/0f0c63a9e73f7c93070293ac970321ab.avif?t=1762420869\" width=754 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong> <br><br><br> You are granted a magical bag filled with countless unique cards, each with its own Time Cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, you must balance a limited Time cap as you draw as many cards as you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude2e One more card?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude0f Another one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude2b Just one more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is always yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision could be a stroke of brilliance, or the start of a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware: exceed your Time cap and a Time Explosion \ud83d\udca5 will erupt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all explosions are disasters, though\u2014play the right cards, and you can twist them into opportunities or avoid them entirely \ud83d\udc4c <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8f99f26a09c9702538e8f2a89b6cf50d.avif?t=1762420869\" width=765 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span>The game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 unique cards\u2014including spells, plants, animals, buildings, and products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 powerful trinkets designed to create combos with different builds or enhance your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so many options, the game offers dozens of distinct strategies, each providing its own unique experience.  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/3291db59f38d0f7f1ac15d973fa04eea.avif?t=1762420869\" width=794 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/6ae37317331c418a993732c3c6bc2ee1.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/6ae37317331c418a993732c3c6bc2ee1.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span>With time as your guiding thread, your journey will challenge you with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ impactful map events filled with meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ harsh years that are difficult to overcome but rich in rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ massive cataclysms with unique mechanics to test your resilience. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/d0eae589796c2671671006ee61eddc03.avif?t=1762420869\" width=782 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong><br><br><br>Open card packs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock supply crates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even try your luck with scratch cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold, new cards, and powerful trinkets\u2014the game offers multiple ways to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reward system is designed to create richer experiences and deeper paths for player progression.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"TimeTech CEO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/6cf2718850053ef008202bdf6427a43346d8bf10.jpg"},{"name":"Permanent Employee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/d6f563a7a97b26092eca6a7a7713f292ed83d04f.jpg"},{"name":"A Modest Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/6f1a1e6f775e65a2a037180fb28bd4b0a611c94a.jpg"},{"name":"Unchallenged Victor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/d7e91e4b13d597e1cb37d7def893f136129b51f9.jpg"},{"name":"Refined to Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/43775ae4a586b25bd29877c8d57753ecb93645f8.jpg"},{"name":"Peace of Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/8f1d103ea82735526f852d6b4ad8916605d81dfd.jpg"},{"name":"Card Overload","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/71162afc25910824f0e755a5ce2801f033bf4c15.jpg"},{"name":"Card Meltdown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/90bb22c421c66e744aa573dbea03762aa7b4d8bf.jpg"},{"name":"Card Apocalypse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/78e470845404f8d3e14078e794faa9a1e344564d.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3177890/e6d6a8a629b9e69c45ff3a812a25e1ee7a01daf3.jpg"}],"total":55},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3177890?t=1762420869","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3177890?t=1762420869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/e361e736900629883db0827bb32d50a56eb106d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762420869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/e361e736900629883db0827bb32d50a56eb106d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762420869","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed In